<view class="page {{theme}}"><view class="topline home-topline"><view class="home-title-block"><text class="eyebrow">SUMMER TRACES</text><view class="page-title">夏日有迹</view></view><button class="icon-button home-create" bindtap="create" aria-label="新建记录"><image src="/assets/icons/plus.png"/></button></view><view class="welcome">{{name}}，今天有什么值得留下？</view><view class="search"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/search.png"/><input placeholder="寻找一段文字、一枚标签" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search"/><button class="icon-button" bindtap="favoriteFilter" aria-label="筛选收藏"><image src="{{favorites?'/assets/icons/heart-filled.png':'/assets/icons/heart.png'}}"/></button></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="chips"><view class="chip {{mood===item?'selected':''}}" wx:for="{{moods}}" wx:key="*this" data-key="mood" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="filter">{{item}}</view></scroll-view><scroll-view scroll-x class="chips tags"><view wx:for="{{tags}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{tag===item?'selected':''}}" data-key="tag" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="filter"># {{item}}</view></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{draft}}" class="notice" bindtap="create">有一篇未完成的草稿 <text>继续写 →</text></view><view class="section-heading"><text>生活的切片</text><text class="muted small">{{count}} 篇记录</text></view><view class="entry-card" style="border-top-color:{{item.color||'#dfe8e2'}};border-top-width:3px" wx:for="{{entries}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image wx:if="{{item.photo}}" class="entry-photo" src="{{item.photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="entry-content"><view class="row between"><text class="date">{{item.dateLabel}}</text><text class="mood">{{item.mood}}</text></view><view class="entry-title">{{item.displayTitle}}</view><view class="excerpt">{{item.excerpt}}</view><view class="row entry-tags"><text wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tagName" wx:key="*this"># {{tagName}}</text><image wx:if="{{item.favorite}}" class="icon small-icon" src="/assets/icons/heart-filled.png"/></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!entries.length}}" class="empty"><image src="/assets/icons/book-open.png"/><view>还没有找到这段时光</view><text>留下第一篇记录，或换个条件找找。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="create">写一篇记录</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="clear">清除筛选</button></view><view class="footer-note">把平凡的一天，认真收藏。</view></view>
